# Golden-test diagnostics. `flutter test` writes master/test/diff PNGs here on
# a failure, to be looked at and thrown away. They were committed once, by
# accident, in the same change that legitimately updated a golden — which is
# exactly when the mistake is easiest to make, because `git add -A` cannot tell
# the artefact from the intended update.
/test/golden/failures/
